<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1721454116"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:07.093"><div begin="21.384" end="41.637"><p begin="21.384" end="23.256" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.384" end="21.928">我的生活</span><span begin="21.928" end="22.312">像</span><span begin="22.312" end="22.827">拍了一出</span><span begin="22.827" end="23.256">戏</span></p><p begin="23.266" end="25.773" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.266" end="23.550">有超多</span><span begin="23.550" end="24.208">导演跟编</span><span begin="24.208" end="24.498">剧</span> <span begin="24.498" end="25.410">只说了台词一</span><span begin="25.410" end="25.773">句</span></p><p begin="25.783" end="28.640" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.783" end="26.340">而他们配了</span><span begin="26.340" end="27.028">八百个语</span><span begin="27.028" end="27.360">气</span> <span begin="27.360" end="27.954">操控着我</span><span begin="27.954" end="28.278">的情</span><span begin="28.278" end="28.640">绪</span></p><p begin="28.642" end="31.449" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.642" end="29.049">那根本</span><span begin="29.049" end="29.802">不是我的口</span><span begin="29.802" end="30.159">气</span> <span begin="30.159" end="30.742">想让观众</span><span begin="30.742" end="31.084">看好</span><span begin="31.084" end="31.449">戏</span></p><p begin="31.459" end="34.028" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.459" end="31.855">最后的</span><span begin="31.855" end="32.344">目的</span> <span begin="32.344" end="33.009">还不是在</span><span begin="33.009" end="33.658">促进收视</span><span begin="33.658" end="34.028">率</span></p><p begin="34.027" end="36.884" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.027" end="34.611">我不知道</span><span begin="34.611" end="35.742">我有没有勇气拆下</span><span begin="35.742" end="36.169">他们的</span><span begin="36.169" end="36.470">面</span><span begin="36.470" end="36.884">具</span></p><p begin="36.894" end="39.066" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.894" end="37.349">我只知道</span><span begin